#. 苗木君の推理通りだとすると…
msgctxt "0001 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Let's test Makoto's assertion."
msgstr ""

#. 大和田君は以前…
msgctxt "0002 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If what he says is correct,\n"
"then Mondo..."
msgstr ""

#. 自分の電子生徒手帳を
#. 壊している事になるわね…
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "You broke your own handbook."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、大和田君の生徒手帳が
#. 壊れていれば…
msgctxt "0004 | CELES"
msgid ""
"In other words, if Mondo's handbook\n"
"is actually broken..."
msgstr ""

#. 今の推理が正しいという事に
#. なりますわね。
msgctxt "0005 | CELES"
msgid ""
"...then that proves that\n"
"what Makoto said is right."
msgstr ""

#. オレの電子生徒手帳は
#. <CLT 9>ちゃんと動く<CLT>ぞ…
msgctxt "0006 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Well my goddamn handbook\n"
"<CLT 9>works just fine<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. ほ、ほら見ろ！
msgctxt "0007 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "S-See? Look!"
msgstr ""

#. やはり、苗木くんの推理は
#. <CLT 9>間違っている<CLT>んだ！
msgctxt "0008 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Makoto was <CLT 9>wrong<CLT>, after all!"
msgstr ""

#. 兄弟が人を殺すはずがないんだッ！
msgctxt "0009 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Mondo wouldn't hurt a fly!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>なるほどな…<CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "<CLT 26>Interesting...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>そうなりますな…<CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "<CLT 26>That would definitely prove it...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>大和田がクロなの？<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "<CLT 26>Mondo's the blackened?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>それは本当にあなたの…？<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "<CLT 26>Was it really him...?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>あれ？　動くの？<CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "<CLT 26>Huh? Does it actually work?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>そんな事言っても…<CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "<CLT 26>Maybe, but...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>なんで動くの？<CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "<CLT 26>HOW does it work!?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>美しき友情…うける！<CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "<CLT 26>Some friend you are!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>そうか…そういうことか。<CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "<CLT 26>So that's what that means...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>反論の余地ないべ！<CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "<CLT 26>You can't deny it!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>じゃあ、一体誰が…？<CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "<CLT 26>Then who in the world...?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
